        "ko": "확고함 유지하리.",
        "zh": "絕不受世界奴役。",
        "en": "Far from this world we keep free,",
        "ja": "世から離れて",
        "de": "vom Geist der Welt uns befrein.",
        "fr": "Fuyons ce monde incertain,",
